      "id": "PR_kwDOH2Qg5s7WEh7K",
      "title": "fix: upon finding a bitcoin attributes deposited tx, ensure that we have it and all of its ancestors",
      "author": "ClaytonNorthey92",
      "number": 787,
      "body": "\r\n* when forkChoiceUpdated is called, check the payload attributes for bitcoin attributes deposited transactions\r\n* ensure that we have the headers stored in the aforementioned bitcoin attributes deposited transaction, otherwise request it from peers\r\n* upon receiving a bitcoin block from peers via p2p, ensure that we have all ancestors\r\n\r\nfixes https://github.com/hemilabs/op-geth/issues/79",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/op-geth",
